    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f901770635fee88826abb5d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既有旺盛的斗志，却又有冷静的判断。\r\n还有她那惊人的脚力……无论哪方面她都很出色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea8dbd30639615c6ee107a8feddea5a83b2e0c8f55efa01a0b65193f69b09ede",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018001.json",
