    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7695f39476cbc24d060ae80d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽就这样拉开了与无声铃鹿之间的距离，\r\n冲过了终点线……",
      "source_fingerprint": "00955ce99308ea304697fe5fae8851c1ff7872acf3ed3272378df09fdefcfe2a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1018/storytimeline_041018001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:534bf4bfa4428fca16b53c14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我被她所折服，不由自主地呆站在原地。\r\n这时，听到了观看比赛的孩子们兴奋的感想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b41e66e92522d9f63890b89b957aedde9ea697640901202820a80a643f10684",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
