      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀ー，看到了一场好比赛呢！\r\n下回我也想跟她单挑一下呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e561f6f34a1f44603a4aca9708ebd5386c9f51ff558af46e7981eb94d338e60",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
