      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊。她拥有着那样的赛场判断能力，\r\n向我们展示着堪称理想的跑法……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6829114067477737b40c30b702b25dcf70da9d65ec3ad056932e39ed60f2744",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
